████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
█
█ Features:
█
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
█
█  - ANTI RECOIL: Automatically compensates weapon recoil.
█  - AA ROCKET: Aim assist polar with tracker movement pattern.
█  🔧 SETTINGS:
█  	  - Left Size: Adjusts the size of the left aim assist movement.
█  	  - Left Speed: Controls the speed of the left aim assist movement.
█  	  - Right Size: Adjusts the size of the right aim assist movement.
█  	  - Right Speed: Controls the speed of the right aim assist movement.
█  	  - Active on ADS: Toggles activation while aiming down sights.
█  	  - Activation Max: Sets the maximum activation threshold.
█  	  - Activation Min: Sets the minimum activation threshold.
█  	  - Boost Strength: Configures the strength of aim assist boost.
█  	  - Threshold: Defines the trigger threshold for activation.
█  	  - Dynamic: Enables or disables dynamic mode for aim assist.
█  	  - Shape: Selects the shape of the aim assist pattern (e.g., circle, square).
█     - Smoothing Factor: Smoothens aim transitions for precision (Controls smoothing speed for angle transitions).
█	  - Lock Helper: Controls the aim assist strength (how much the game helps align the crosshair with targets).
█
█  - AUTO RUN: Enables automatic running with configurable options.
█  - HOLD BREATH: Automatically holds breath when aiming down sights.
█  🔧 SETTINGS:
█  	  - Breath Timer (s): Duration for holding breath (in seconds).
█  	  - Time before (s): Delay before activation (in seconds).
█     - Cooldown (ms): Cooldown period between activations (in milliseconds).
█  - NO RUMBLE: Disables controller vibrations.
█  - ANTI AFK: Prevents inactivity disconnections.
█  - AUTO PING: Auto ping enemy.
█  🔧 SETTINGS:
█	- Trigger Timer (s): Delay before activation (in seconds).
█  - SLIDE CANCEL: stop slidding after x seconds.
█  🔧 SETTINGS:
█	- Cancel Delay (s): Delay before stop to slide (in seconds).
█  - Inverted Axis : Invert Axis
█
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
█
█ Setup Menu Navigation 🚀 :
█
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
█
█ 🎛 Navigation Controls :
█ 🎯 Entering the Setup Menu ➝ Hold 'ADS' & Press 'MENU'
█ 📂 Accessing a Submenu ➝ Press A (CROSS)
█ ↩ Exiting a Submenu ➝ Press B (CIRCLE)
█ 🚪 💾 Saving & Exiting ➝ Press Y
█ 🚪 Exiting Without Saving in memory ( changes will be reseted next time you run the script ) ➝ Press B (CIRCLE)
█
█ 🔧 Modifying Settings :
█ ▶ Switch Options ➝ Use LEFT/RIGHT
█ 🔼 Change Values ➝ UP/DOWN (Main Menu) | LEFT/RIGHT (Submenus)
█
█ 🔧  For anti recoil :
█ Use LB / RB to change profile to setup.
█
█ 💡 Pro Tip: When you like your settings, Always press Y to save your changes before shutting down the Cronus Zen or opening a new script !
█
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
█
█ Main Screen Controls 🚀 :
█
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
█
█ 🎮 Main Screen Functions:
█ 🕶️ Turn Off Screen Saver ➝ Press VIEW button
█ 🎯 Entering the Setup Menu ➝ Hold 'ADS' & Press 'MENU'
█ 🔄 Change Profile ➝ Each time you Press Y button
█
█ ⚡ Forcing Profiles:
█ 1️⃣ Force Profile 1 ➝ Hold VIEW button + Press Y
█ 2️⃣ Force Profile 2 ➝ Hold VIEW button + Press B
█
█ 🛑 Enabling & Disabling RocketMod
█ ❌ Deactivate RocketMod Script ➝ Hold 'ADS' & Press 'VIEW' button
█ ✅ Reactivate RocketMod Script ➝ Hold 'ADS' & Press 'VIEW' button
█
█ 💡 Pro Tip: If your script isn’t responding, try deactivating and reactivating it with 'ADS' + VIEW or change to an other script and go back to RocketMod slot to reset!
█
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
