█	🔹 Virtual Machine Base Time Optimization – The script now adjusts the base time dynamically depending on the controller, making execution more efficient for PS5 and Xbox controllers.
█	🔹 New Auto Ping Feature – We've added an auto ping with a built-in timer, preventing spam while keeping communication seamless.
█	🔹Setup menu UI, UX bug fixes.
█	v2.6 :
